          "python",
          "Is the number of clusters known?\n\u251c\u2500 YES \u2192 K-Means (fast) or GMM (probabilistic)\n\u251c\u2500 NO  \u2192 Go to next question\n\nAre clusters likely to be non-convex or varying density?\n\u251c\u2500 YES \u2192 DBSCAN or Hierarchical\n\u251c\u2500 NO  \u2192 K-Means or GMM\n\nData size?\n\u251c\u2500 Small (< 10k) \u2192 Hierarchical (for dendrogram) or DBSCAN\n\u251c\u2500 Medium (10k-100k) \u2192 K-Means or DBSCAN\n\u251c\u2500 Large (> 100k) \u2192 K-Means (most scalable)\n\nNeed soft assignments and uncertainty?\n\u251c\u2500 YES \u2192 GMM\n\u251c\u2500 NO  \u2192 K-Means or DBSCAN"
        ]
      ]
